<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE - Riverside County Asset Leasing.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE - Riverside County Asset Leasing.</headline>
<text>
<p>COUNTY OF RIVERSIDE ASSET LEASING CORPORATION</p>
<p>RE: $71,985,000</p>
<p>LEASEHOLD REVENUE BONDS, 1997 SERIES B &amp; C</p>
<p>(COUNTY OF RIVERSIDE HOSPITAL PROJECT)</p>
<p>Effective at 2:45 P.M. E.D.T., Friday, August 1, 1997</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Samuel A. Ramirez &amp; Company, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
